Explicitly balanced postings in two commodities produce no warnings.

========== API ==========

aggregate()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Cash
account Assets:Fund
account Equity:Opening
2024-01-01 Balanced
  Assets:Cash  1 SEK
  Equity:Opening  -1 SEK
  Assets:Fund  2 FUND
  Equity:Opening  -2 FUND

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:Cash",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "1"
  },
  {
    "account": "Assets:Fund",
    "commodity": "FUND",
    "quantity": "2"
  },
  {
    "account": "Equity:Opening",
    "commodity": "FUND",
    "quantity": "-2"
  },
  {
    "account": "Equity:Opening",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "-1"
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========


